+# round 1 caught this). `*data_paths_mr` already covers ingestion/dbt/checks/
+# requirements; this adds what changes the IMAGE ITSELF and is not a dbt/CI input:
+# the root Dockerfile, `.dockerignore`, and the two files entrypoint.sh's shebang
