+  # PUSH-to-main only. Without the explicit $CI_PIPELINE_SOURCE == "push" check a
+  # web dispatch on main would ALSO match the branch clause (changes: evaluates
+  # TRUE on any non-push/non-MR pipeline) and rebuild the image on every manual
+  # run of anything else in this file.
